  m_text: "Shatter Force\n\n\nRay, can you prove you're you and break free from your
    reflections dark intent?\n\nControls: Left and Right mouse button\n\nGoal: When
    your reflections left hand appears, hold left click and when his right hand appears,
    hold right click. \n\nTime: Time is everything in the mirror realm. Hold the
    mouse button long enough for the next hand to appear but always release before
    pressing again even if the same hand appears more than once in a row\n\nDon't
    Let the TIMER hit zero\nor be REPLACED by your double\n*click this box to begin*"
